          "title": "WinTAK Plugin Management",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>To add or update WinTAK plugins, download the installation files from the Deploy app.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "1. Open WinTAK Import Functionality",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open Menu from the hamburger icon</li>\n<li>Open Import files functionality</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c89fb3cfc2ff4804.webp",
              "width": 461,
              "height": 429
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Select Plugins",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Navigate into the folder where you downloaded plugin files.</li>\n<li>Choose plugins you want to install or update</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6ab695625e3d98e1.webp",
              "width": 944,
              "height": 528
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "3. Import Successful",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>After successful import restart the WinTAK</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8b6953cdd0d8b8fe.webp",
